# Normalise line endings.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true writes CRLF into the
# working tree while git stores LF. Prettier then reports every line of every
# file as `Delete ␍` -- ~1,470 phantom errors that do not exist in CI, which
# trains everyone to ignore `npm run lint`.
#
# `eol=lf` makes the working copy match what is stored, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
